        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Coarse cotton ground, printed with woodblocks in brownish purple. Two vertical repeats of design showing two seated women, a goat, and a man in a wooded area.  The man holds the goat's head while one woman lifts its leg and a child in her lap drinks from its udder.  The other woman holds two shallow dishes or pans and looks away at a fountain.  Many small holes."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/64540b5b-d35e-312a-b2bd-3b035ca4e30b> ;
